 Ordinary Differential Equations 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize

In solving the characteristic equation, two cases emerge: 
\end_layout

\begin_deeper
\begin_layout Enumerate

The roots of the characteristic equation are all distinct. 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Enumerate

Some roots are repeated, i.e., each root 
\begin_inset Formula $r_i$
\end_inset

 has multiplicity 
\begin_inset Formula $n_i$
\end_inset

. 
\end_layout

\end_deeper
