\begin_layout Itemize

The total response can also be decomposed into transient and steady state responses 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize

The 
\shape italic

\series bold
transient
\series default

\shape default
 response is that part of the total response that decays to 0 as 
\begin_inset Formula $t\rightarrow \infty$
\end_inset

. 
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize

The 
\shape italic

\series bold
steady state response
\series default

\shape default
 is the difference between the total response and the transient response. 
\end_layout

